  ok   a capability of the wrong kind gives E_NOCAP
  ok   a copy of a capability has the same rights or fewer
  ok   a badge is set once, and only by a holder of the grant right
  ok   a dropped capability is gone
  ok   an I/O port capability reaches its ports and no others
  ok   an interrupt capability reaches its lines and no others
